   "subject": "How do input variables communicate with output ones in the server.r?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Dear all,<div>I am trying to write a very simple shiny program in which I select a column of a data.frame called &quot;datos&quot; (defined with a sidebarPanel in the ui.r), then </div><div>1. plot the boxplot of the selected column (called &quot;variable&quot; in the ui.r)</div><div>and </div><div>2. show the summary of the selected column</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\">shinyServer(<span style=\"color:#c3880b\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>){</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\">#first define formulaText:</p></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">formulaText</span> &lt;- reactive(<span style=\"color:#c3880b\">function</span>(){ </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#191699\"> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>paste(</span>input<span style=\"color:#191699\">$</span>variable<span style=\"color:#191699\">,</span><span style=\"color:#b01301\">&quot;~datos$R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#191699\">) </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\">                                 <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> })</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\">#then define the field gPlot for output:</p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(25,22,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">gPlot</span><span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>reactivePlot(<span style=\"color:#c3880b\">function</span>(){</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(25,22,153)\"><span style=\"color:#b01301\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span><a href=\"http://plot.new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://plot.new&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792410685081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HkwNaMpBqdAJwGIp5Bjk6\">plot.new</a>()<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\">#</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(25,22,153)\"><span style=\"color:#b01301\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>boxplot(as.formula(formulaText()),</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,1)\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        <span style=\"color:#000000\">data</span> <span style=\"color:#191699\">=</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">mpgData</span> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,1)\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        <span style=\"color:#191699\">)</span> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,1);min-height:16px\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,1)\">                                        <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#191699\">})</span></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">So far so good. But how can I do to define also an output$summary with the summary(input$variable)?</span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Do I need to define something like formulaText **before** then pass it to the output$summary?</span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">A more general question is: how do variables from input and fields of output communicate to each other? </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Why I can not simply write something like the following structure?</font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"></font></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">summary</span><span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>reactivePrint(<span style=\"color:#c3880b\">function</span>()<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>{</font></p><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\"><span style=\"color:#333233\">    </span>summary(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input$variable</span>)<span style=\"color:#b01301\">  </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#b01301\"><span style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5\">    </span><span style=\"color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\">})</span>                                     <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#b01301;min-height:16.0px\">      </p></font><p></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Many thanks,</span><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Giovanna</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></span></p></div>"
