t></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">summary</span><span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>reactivePrint(<span style=\"color:#c3880b\">function</span>()<span style=\"color:#b01301\"> </span>{</font></p><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\"><span style=\"color:#333233\">    </span>summary(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input$variable</span>)<span style=\"color:#b01301\">  </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#b01301\"><span style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5\">    </span><span style=\"color:#191699;background-color:#f5f5f5\">})</span>                                     <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#b01301;min-height:16.0px\">      </p></font><p></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font:normal normal normal 11.9px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Many thanks,</span><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Giovanna</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.9px Monaco;color:#191699\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"mar