     1,
     "Thanks Joe,<div><span>yes indeed. That was my problem and also part of the answer to my question. </span></div><div><span>I thought that input$variable was already recognized in the server.r </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"> as the input selected column, that is as an array. Instead, it is not and it has to be referred as datos[,input$variable].</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\">Thank you very much</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\">Giovanna</span></div>"
    ],
    [
